    "chunk_text": "& Moyse bef\u00e6ste; & Crist on his godspelle eft hy \u00d0\u00e6t is rihtlic lagu, & se bi\u00f0 ges\u00e6lig se \u00fee hy gehealde\u00f0. \u00deas beboda & fela hertoeacan we sculon healdan, be \u00feam \u00fee us Cristes bec gelomlice l\u00e6ra\u00f0, gif we Eala, leofan men, us is swy\u00f0e mycel \u00feearf \u00fe\u00e6t we ofer ealle o\u00f0re \u00feing God huru lufian & his larum & Ealle we habba\u00f0 \u00e6nne heofonlicne f\u00e6der & ane gastlice modor, seo is ecclesia genamod, \u00fe\u00e6t is Godes La hw\u00e6t, frema\u00f0 cyrichatan cristendom on unnyt, for\u00f0am \u00e6lc \u00fe\u00e6ra bi\u00f0 Godes feond \u00fee bi\u00f0 Godes And egeslice sp\u00e6c Gregorius be \u00f0am \u00fea \u00f0a he \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0: si quis ecclesiam Dei denudauerit uel Se \u00f0e Godes cyrican, he cw\u00e6\u00f0, rype o\u00f0\u00f0e reafige o\u00f0\u00f0e halignessa gri\u00f0 scyrde o\u00f0\u00f0e wyrde, a he Eala, rihte gedafena\u00f0 cristenum mannum \u00fe\u00e6t hi Crist sylfne geefenl\u00e6can georne, \u00fe\u00e6s \u00f0e hy don \u00d0\u00e6t is, \u00fe\u00e6t gehwa georne unriht forl\u00e6te & inwerdre heortan hwyrfe to rihte for Gode & for worulde. La, hu m\u00e6g man ea\u00f0ost gehwyrfan fram yfele & fram unrihte, butan \u00fe\u00e6t man deofol georne forbuge & \u00d0\u00e6t is gitsung & gifernes, galnes & weamodnys, unrotnys & asolcennys, gylpgeornys & ofermodignys. Of \u00f0yson eahta deofles cr\u00e6ftan ealle un\u00feeawas up aspringa\u00f0 & sy\u00f0\u00fean to",
